This package does not contain the slides / documents editor. The local app downloads it on first use into
~/.cache/instructional-agents/editor/<version>/ (or uses a build named by IA_EDITOR_DIR), checks its SHA-256,
and serves it to the browser at /editor/. Without it, the app uses the hosted editor at https://edit.chaxus.com.


Editor (separate program, downloaded at run time)
-------------------------------------------------

The editor is a trimmed build of ranuts/document (https://github.com/ranuts/document), the web front end that
embeds the ONLYOFFICE document editors:

  * ONLYOFFICE sdkjs and web-apps, Copyright (C) Ascensio System SIA
    https://github.com/ONLYOFFICE/sdkjs, https://github.com/ONLYOFFICE/web-apps
  * ranuts/document, Copyright (C) its authors

Both are licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License version 3 (AGPL-3.0) with the additional terms
permitted by its Section 7. The build Instructional Agents distributes is a modified version of ranuts/document
(branch studio-embed: an embedding API for opening, saving and running macros from the host page, and a build
that keeps only the presentation and document editors). Its complete corresponding source code is published in
its own repository, a fork of ranuts/document, and every editor release asset names the commit it was built
from. The editor package carries its own LICENSE and NOTICE files, which apply to it.

Instructional Agents talks to the editor only through its postMessage interface from a separate page; it does not
link to or include editor code. The MIT license of this package does not apply to the editor.


